                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>Amber filtering, not a tint.</strong> Amber sits opposite blue on the color wheel, so the lens cuts the harsh blue light modern LED headlights throw at you.</p><p><strong>GlareCut Technology™.</strong> It turns blinding white headlights into a soft, warm orange. Your eyes handle orange light far more comfortably than stark white, so glare drops and the blinding effect softens.</p>",
